installed (https://www.fmods.net/). Those are separate works made by other people.
They are under their own terms, which this project does not control and does not
restate. Nothing from FMods is copied, bundled or redistributed here: no jailbreak
files, no Installer/Daemon, no FMods Tools, and no mod from SyncDB. The stick this
repository builds calls the hook the FMods installer provides; it does not contain it.

Ford and SYNC are trademarks of their owners. No Ford binary, Ford QML or other Ford
file is in this repository. The HMI edits are short fragments that the reader applies
